        <item>
            <title>3.19.0</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 14:54:31 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>204</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.19.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features
- A mirror pane of a session on another Mac can now connect to and disconnect from a Slack thread from its pane menu. The binding is made on the Mac that runs the session, and its Slack chip shows on the mirror pane.
- Paired clients over Tailscale (other Macs and Canopy Mobile) may now bind sessions to Slack threads. A binding stays until its expiry even if the pairing password is reset.
]]></description>
